                            my best even if I'm not very brave.
                        """,
                    }
                case 2:
                    {
                        english="""
                             I've decided that I can still do
                            my best even if I'm not very brave.
                        """,
                    }
                default:
                    {
                        english="""
                             I've decided that I can still do
                            my best even if I'm not very brave.
                        """,
                    }
            }
            message_SwitchTalk ($PARTNER_TALK_KIND) {
                case 1:
                    {
                        english="""
                             I won't let something like this
